  "description": "<p>When I introduced the first weighted blanket in 1998 people looked at\r\n me confused. “Why would anybody want a blanket with weight \r\nintentionally added in it?” was the question I kept hearing.</p>\r\n<p>Then we gave one of our weighted blankets to a friend who taught \r\ndisabled children. The sensory input created by applying direct pressure\r\n on the body showed immediate results with her students. It would prove \r\nto be revolutionary and life-changing.</p>\r\n<p>We sold our first mini-blanket later that year for $20. Little did I \r\nknow at the time that my counter-intuitive invention would create a mass\r\n market sensation.&nbsp; According to MarketWatch, weighted blankets \r\ngenerated over $290 million in sales globally in 2020.&nbsp; In 2027, that \r\nnumber is projected to be over $1.3 billion.</p>\r\n<p>That phenomenal success is due to one reason – being hugged under a \r\nweighted blanket reduces anxiety and improves sleep. If it wasn’t true, \r\nwe would not be here 24 years later.</p>\r\n<p>As the demand for weighted blankets grows, most of that demand is now\r\n being met by overseas manufacturers, many of whom are producing \r\ninferior products using unfair and unethical labor practices.</p>\r\n<p>We are on a mission to help our customers make informed purchase \r\ndecisions that don’t compromise quality and treat workers fairly by \r\npaying them a living wage.</p>\r\n<p>So we are recruiting <strong>Magic Weighted Blanket Sleep Ambassadors</strong>\r\n to share our story, to offer customers a better and more humane choice,\r\n and make a little money &nbsp;- all while helping the world sleep <strong>more</strong> and stress <strong>less.</strong></p>\r\n<p>Sign up to be a <strong>Magic Weighted Blanket Sleep Ambassador</strong>\r\n and earn a 10% commission, or more, on every sale. And the customer you\r\n send to us will receive a 10% discount automatically. It’s a win win. \r\nAnd you will be helping support a product <strong>Made In America</strong> that will bring calm, comfort and better sleep to an increasingly stressed out world.</p>",
